\label{app:vision_moe}

To test whether normalization-induced routing collapse transfers beyond time series, we construct a controlled vision experiment: ResNet-18 (pretrained on ImageNet, adapted for CIFAR-10) as backbone, with $K{=}5$ architecturally diverse expert classifiers (mean-pool, max-pool, attention-pool, conv-pool, last-patch---matching the time-series expert pool), no load-balancing loss, and the same four conditions tested in the time-series experiments.

